<title>SWITZERLAND: Forbo posts higher 1997 oper profit.</title>
<headline>Forbo posts higher 1997 oper profit.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended June 30</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group oper profit	    50		  vs 47</p>
<p> Gross profit		   446		 vs 410</p>
<p> Gross sales		    1,026	     vs 940</p>
<p> Cash flow			88		  vs 83</p>
